   "text": "🍋🍰 Cream Cheese 7UP Pound Cake! 💚✨\n\n👇🏾RECIPE 👇🏾\n📝 Ingredients:\n\n • 3 cups cake flour\n • 3 sticks unsalted butter, softened\n • 8 oz cream cheese, softened\n • 3 cups granulated sugar\n • 1½ tsp clear vanilla extract\n • 1 tsp lemon extract\n • 5 large eggs\n • ¾ cup 7UP soda\n\n👩🏽‍🍳 Instructions:\n\n 1. Preheat your oven to 325°F.\n 2. Cream together the softened butter and cream cheese until smooth.\n 3. Add the sugar and beat for 3–4 minutes until light and fluffy.\n 4. Add the eggs one at a time, mixing well after each addition.\n 5. Mix in the vanilla and lemon extracts.\n 6. Alternately add the cake flour and 7UP, beginning and ending with the flour. Mix just until combined.\n 7. Pour the batter into a greased and floured Bundt or pound cake pan.\n 8. Bake for 1 hour and 15 minutes, or until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.\n 9. Let cool, then slice and enjoy! 🤤🍰\n\n#PoundCakeLovers #HomemadeDesserts #SouthernBaking #CakeLovers #DessertInspiration",
